<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Gold Fields names new gold operations head.</title>
<headline>Gold Fields names new gold operations head.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>South African mining house Gold Fields of South Africa Ltd said on Tuesday it had appointed Richard Robinson as its new executive director of gold operations.</p>
<p>He replaces Alan Munro from July 1, who is retiring.  </p>
<p>Robinson joined Gold Fields in 1975 and has been executive director of new business and international operations since 1994.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
